    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if i can just 'focus on resilience' though. it feels selfish. every time i need help or can't do something, i can see the look on their faces. like they're just tired of carrying me. it feels like the more i hold on, the more i'm actually hurting them. i just want them to be able to live their own lives without being tethered to my struggles.",
